sequenceDiagram
    participant Device
    participant Token as Token service
    participant MQTT as MQTT / Shadow service
    participant App
    Note over Device,MQTT: R = $vc/devices/device-1/shadow/name/tutorial
    Note over Device: Network loss, old socket closed
    App->>MQTT: PUBLISH R/update (new desired)
    MQTT-->>App: R/update/accepted if authorized
    loop Bounded reconnect attempts
        Device->>Token: HTTPS token reissue or mTLS bootstrap
        Token-->>Device: Current credentials or error
        Device->>MQTT: TLS and MQTT CONNECT
        MQTT-->>Device: CONNACK or rejection
    end
    opt Connected
        Device->>MQTT: SUBSCRIBE R/get/accepted, R/get/rejected, R/update/accepted, R/update/rejected, R/update/delta
        MQTT-->>Device: SUBACK
        Device->>MQTT: PUBLISH R/get (new correlation)
        MQTT-->>Device: R/get/accepted (current desired) or rejected
        Note over Device: Reconcile hardware with current desired
        Device->>MQTT: PUBLISH R/update (actual reported)
        MQTT-->>Device: R/update/accepted
    end
    Note over Device,MQTT: No offline replay or cross-client ordering is assumed
